@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Added ``beacons.status`` to report, per configured beacon, when it last actually fired and whether that run raised an error. The data reflects live beacon activity tracked by the running minion process, so it's accurate immediately after a beacon fires and doesn't require reading logs, waiting for a new probe cycle, or restarting the minion. A beacon that hasn't fired yet reports ``last_run: None``.
